  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 47 plugins (total 15,793) and the official repo gained 321 stars with the dsh 0.1.6-alpha.2 release; desktop projects led growth (dataelement/dsh-desktop +90). However, 12,240 of 15,581 non-fork plugins have been stale for 7 days, giving a health score of 38 — activity is increasingly concentrated among a few projects.",
    "zh": "过去 <b>8</b> 小时生态新增 <b>47</b> 个插件，总量达 <b>15793</b>；官方仓库涨 <b>321</b> 星并发布 dsh <b>0.1.6-alpha.2</b>，桌面端项目领跑增长榜（dataelement/dsh-desktop +<b>90</b>）。不过 <b>15581</b> 个非 fork 插件中 <b>12240</b> 个已 7 天无更新，健康分仅 <b>38</b>，建议持续观察活跃度分化。"
